      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rouyn-Noranda",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighboring town of Noranda, a contraction of “North Canada,” grew around the Horne mine and foundry.",
